 Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D322253\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/prompts/src/main/java/mozilla/components/feature/prompts/dialog/TimePickerDialogFragment.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/prompts/src/test/java/mozilla/components/feature/prompts/dialog/TimePickerDialogFragmentTest.kt"], "git_node": "e7ddc7710a304a73d29a2d4f33e1be70aa12a6d8", "git_parents": ["77be50c7e04d99d302a272b1b399fc06d30b2c35"], "node": "0ddb8190378b2aa7ab9e428310910889afcfafd9", "parents": ["6bf609a772bf39ff434e5ee9e9b3f30872d7c44b"], "tags": []}], "date": 1788177943, "git_changesets": ["e7ddc7710a304a73d29a2d4f33e1be70aa12a6d8"], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "28279": {"changesets": [{"author": "Valentin Gosu \u003cvalentin.gosu@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2051466 - NTLM should always prompt for credentials if the host is not in trusted-uris  a=dmeehan\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D321209\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D322260\n", "files": ["netwerk/protocol/http/nsHttpChannelAuthProvider.cpp"], "git_node": "976e102e4488ff8e802f7c47e688c55334a17f95", "git_parents": ["e7ddc7710a304a73d29a2d4f33e1be70aa12a6d8"], "node": "b0a89c1a769ef3b8d94fa2348e9c8d2963e29fe0", "parents": ["0ddb8190378b2aa7ab9e428310910889afcfafd9"], "tags": []}], "date": 1788177967, "git_changesets": ["976e102e4488ff8e802f7c47e688c55334a17f95"], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "28280": {"changesets": [{"author": "Makoto Kato \u003cm_kato@ga2.so-net.ne.jp\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2027336 - Always call forget.  a=dmeehan\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D322230\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D322280\n", "files": ["intl/components/src/RelativeTimeFormat.cpp"], "git_node": "3531aff86070201b99d51706f4b90bb4a936e3f1", "git_parents": ["976e102e4488ff8e802f7c47e688c55334